## Lab Section 1: FortiGate-WLC Initial Setup

!!! note "Lab Foundation"
    This section establishes the basic infrastructure required for FortiAIOps monitoring and testing.

To validate and test the outcomes you'll implement during this hands-on
lab, you must first configure and enable some of the key features needed
on your FortiGate-WLC and FortiAIOps VMs, along with provisioning the
necessary hardware within your Pod, i.e., FortiSwitch and FortiAPs.

