### AI Insights

With the introduction of FortiAI into FortiAIOps, you will also notice
that within the Forecasting dashboard, there is a **Show AI Insights**
button.

-   Select the **Show AI Insights** button

This tool can be used to ask pre-canned questions about the performance
of the monitored SD-WAN interfaces.

![](media/image173.png){width="3.2085870516185477in"
